# Cloudflare Pages — Strict 404 handling
# Previously: /* /index.html 200  → caused soft-404 (all garbage URLs returned homepage 200)
# Now: Static files in /dist are served directly with 200.
# Missing paths automatically serve /404.html with 404 status (see scripts/prerender.mjs).
# No catch-all rewrite — prevents infinite duplicate content / crawl budget waste.
